<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Removed from Team</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #0f172a; color: #f8fafc; padding: 20px; }
    .card { background: #1e293b; border-radius: 8px; padding: 30px; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; border: 1px solid #334155; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <h2>You Have Been Removed from {{teamName}}</h2>
    <p>Hi {{name}},</p>
    <p>Your membership in <strong>{{teamName}}</strong> has been ended.</p>
    <p style="color: #3ECFCF;">✅ Your personal URLs and account remain completely safe and untouched.</p>
    <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #94a3b8;">If you believe this was an error, please contact your team administrator.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
